{"id":"n38365-2-7","stage":4,"title":"까마득하다 · 模糊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38365-2-7-1","ko":"엄마, 맛있는 음식을 언제 먹었는지 까마득해요.","zh":"妈妈，我已经记不清上一次吃美味食物是什么时候了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있는","audio":"/audio/5adc05669a4242e46918.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"上次，那会儿","explanation":"언제：上次，那会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었는지","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었는지","audio":"/audio/446854da4aeaf7682bea.mp3"}},{"text":"까마득해요.","meaning":"模糊，渺茫","explanation":"까마득하다：模糊，渺茫；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"까마득하다","audio":"/audio/cb3fc2df7474f4ea796a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI